.TH SDL_HINT_VIDEO_X11_VISUALID 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_HINT_VIDEO_X11_VISUALID \- A variable forcing the visual ID used for X11 display modes.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_hints.h>
.PP
.BI "#define SDL_HINT_VIDEO_X11_VISUALID \(dqSDL_VIDEO_X11_VISUALID\(dq
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
This hint should be set before initializing the video subsystem\[char46]

